    "aboutHtml": "<p>I’m a senior frontend engineer at <a href=\"https://www.headout.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Headout</a>, where I work on micro-frontends, payments and AI-integrated developer tooling. I care about fast, native-feeling interfaces on the web and on mobile.</p><p>Outside work I build things I want to use myself: <a href=\"https://nomadsafe.pranav-agarwal.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">NomadSafe</a>, a travel companion app, and <a href=\"https://grain.pranav-agarwal.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">grain</a>, a tool for reviewing pull requests as user flows. Most days that means React, Next.js, React Native and TypeScript, with some Rust and Go when the problem asks for it.</p>"
